    <briefdescription>
<para>An analysis that produces <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_module_info" kindref="compound">MachineModuleInfo</ref></computeroutput> for a module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This does not produce its own <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_module_info" kindref="compound">MachineModuleInfo</ref> because we need a consistent <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_module_info" kindref="compound">MachineModuleInfo</ref> to keep ownership of MachineFunctions regardless of analysis invalidation/clearing. So something outside the analysis infrastructure must own the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_module_info" kindref="compound">MachineModuleInfo</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
